        "detailed_description": "<h1>About us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >e-mail:wszdwymfyzya@<u></u></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/2f0902c93fd27505c1eff99dda2ccaef.avif?t=1757440352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras_big/2f0902c93fd27505c1eff99dda2ccaef.avif?t=1757440352 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange tale haunts the town: when the midnight bell tolls, the &quot;Non-existent Classroom&quot; appears within the school, rumored to summon the souls of the departed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As summer break begins, Xiao Wenfei eagerly drags his childhood friend Fei Xiaoyue to the school, planning to use the urban legend to orchestrate a special surprise—a chance to confess his long-hidden feelings. They succeed in finding the classroom, but what happens next defies all expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Wenfei wakes again, Xiaoyue has vanished. Opening a notebook left behind, he discovers her soul now resides within his body. Yet, only one of them can remain conscious at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the ​curse, the pair embarks on a perilous investigation of the mysterious classroom. As clues accumulate, they uncover a truth far more cruel than they imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town to gather clues.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.poster.avif?t=1757440352\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.webm?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.mp4?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present key evidence to pivotal characters to advance the plot.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.poster.avif?t=1757440352\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.webm?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.mp4?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Profiles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/5a2224d5bb0f2df574b758a2204737d8.avif?t=1757440352\" width=267 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xiao Wenfei</strong><br>A chuunibyou (adolescent delusions of grandeur) student obsessed with the supernatural, driven by a strong sense of justice.<br>He drags Fei Xiaoyue to the school at midnight to find the &quot;extra classroom,&quot; only to collide with real supernatural forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/4d2399103828e40656c1fb0280019813.avif?t=1757440352\" width=267 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fei Xiaoyue</strong><br>Wenfei’s friend, living in a reorganized family. Despite her academic excellence, she feels overlooked at home.<br>Though she follows Wenfei to search for the classroom, Xiaoyue harbors her own secrets.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/2f0902c93fd27505c1eff99dda2ccaef.avif?t=1757440352\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras_big/2f0902c93fd27505c1eff99dda2ccaef.avif?t=1757440352 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange tale haunts the town: when the midnight bell tolls, the &quot;Non-existent Classroom&quot; appears within the school, rumored to summon the souls of the departed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As summer break begins, Xiao Wenfei eagerly drags his childhood friend Fei Xiaoyue to the school, planning to use the urban legend to orchestrate a special surprise—a chance to confess his long-hidden feelings. They succeed in finding the classroom, but what happens next defies all expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Wenfei wakes again, Xiaoyue has vanished. Opening a notebook left behind, he discovers her soul now resides within his body. Yet, only one of them can remain conscious at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the ​curse, the pair embarks on a perilous investigation of the mysterious classroom. As clues accumulate, they uncover a truth far more cruel than they imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town to gather clues.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.poster.avif?t=1757440352\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.webm?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/127a452863ff910a926a81bdce5d104e.mp4?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present key evidence to pivotal characters to advance the plot.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.poster.avif?t=1757440352\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.webm?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/75fcd3902d74e7b5b57dfb03fd8e9ec9.mp4?t=1757440352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Profiles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/5a2224d5bb0f2df574b758a2204737d8.avif?t=1757440352\" width=267 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xiao Wenfei</strong><br>A chuunibyou (adolescent delusions of grandeur) student obsessed with the supernatural, driven by a strong sense of justice.<br>He drags Fei Xiaoyue to the school at midnight to find the &quot;extra classroom,&quot; only to collide with real supernatural forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270110/extras/4d2399103828e40656c1fb0280019813.avif?t=1757440352\" width=267 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fei Xiaoyue</strong><br>Wenfei’s friend, living in a reorganized family. Despite her academic excellence, she feels overlooked at home.<br>Though she follows Wenfei to search for the classroom, Xiaoyue harbors her own secrets.</p>",
